From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement _findfirst32i64 and _findnext32i64 with their wide forms.

_findfirst32i64, _findnext32i64, _wfindfirst32i64 and _wfindnext32i64 (32-bit
times, 64-bit sizes) were spec stubs in msvcr80 .. msvcr120 and ucrtbase
(with its _o_ forms); msvcr120_app forwards.
